# YouTube API Quota Screencast - TTS Script v2.0

> **전략 변경**: Human-in-the-loop 강조 + YouTube 생태계 기여
> **권장 Voice**: `onyx` (전문적), `alloy` (친근함)
> **총 길이**: 약 4분

---

## SECTION 1: Introduction (25초)
```
Hello. Thank you for reviewing our YouTube API quota request.

My name is [Your Name], and I lead the content team at AI Shorts Factory.

In this video, I'll walk you through how our team creates and publishes high-quality educational content for YouTube.
```

---

## SECTION 2: Our Mission (30초)
```
Our mission is to provide valuable, educational content to Korean seniors aged 50 to 60.

We cover topics like health and wellness, financial literacy, and lifestyle tips.

Every piece of content we create is designed to inform, educate, and add genuine value to our viewers' lives.
```

---

## SECTION 3: Our Content Creation Process (50초) ⭐ 핵심!
```
Let me explain our content creation workflow.

Our process involves multiple stages, and each stage requires human review and approval before moving forward.

First, our content strategist selects topics based on audience research and trending interests.

Then, our writers develop scripts with the help of AI tools. However, every script is manually reviewed and edited by our editorial team.

Next, our design team creates visuals. Again, each image and video clip is reviewed for quality and brand consistency.

Finally, before any video is published, our quality assurance team performs a thorough review to ensure compliance with YouTube's Community Guidelines.

Only after passing all these checkpoints, the content is approved for publication.
```

---

## SECTION 4: YouTube Upload Process (35초)
```
Once our team approves a video, we use the YouTube Data API to upload it efficiently.

This is where we need the API quota.

We use the videos.insert endpoint for uploading, and videos.update for setting proper titles, descriptions, and tags.

The API allows us to maintain a consistent publishing schedule while ensuring every upload has been properly reviewed by our team.
```

---

## SECTION 5: Our Contribution to YouTube (40초) ⭐ 핵심!
```
We believe our content contributes positively to the YouTube ecosystem.

Our videos are original, educational, and designed to keep viewers engaged.

We focus on watch time and viewer satisfaction, which aligns perfectly with YouTube's algorithm and recommendation system.

By providing quality content consistently, we help YouTube deliver valuable videos to an underserved demographic: Korean seniors who are looking for trustworthy information.

This is a win-win for YouTube, for our viewers, and for our team.
```

---

## SECTION 6: Quota Justification (35초)
```
Here's why we need an increased API quota.

We manage 20 YouTube channels, each focusing on different content categories for our audience.

After our quality review process, we publish approximately 40 videos per day across all channels.

Each upload requires about 1,600 API units.

Our current quota of 10,000 units is not sufficient to support our publishing schedule.

We are requesting 100,000 units per day to continue delivering quality content to our viewers.
```

---

## SECTION 7: Closing (20초)
```
Thank you for considering our request.

We are fully committed to YouTube's Terms of Service and Community Guidelines.

Our goal is to be a positive contributor to the YouTube platform.

If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out.

Thank you.
```

